\n<p>Mark rented an<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（住所）</span>with his<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（退休金）</span> near the<span class=\"blank\"></span> <span class=\"cue\">（海岸）</span>.He paid annual visits there to enjoy the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（生动的）</span>beauty in the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（深处）</span>of the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（纯净的）</span>sea.</p>\n\n<p>Once, with his underwater<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（望远镜）</span>and<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（手电筒）</span>.Mark <span class=\"cue\">（潜）</span>along the<span class=\"cue\">（分界线）</span>between the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（陡峭的）</span>reef and the area of<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（海草）</span><span class=\"cue\">（保护区）</span>. Suddenly an<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（令人害怕的）</span><span class=\"cue\">（南极的）</span><span class=\"cue\">（海豹）</span>with<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（尖利的）</span>teeth appeared<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（在…对面）</span>him. Every Cell in his body was<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（被吓到）</span>. But soon, he was aware that he wasn't the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（目标）</span>of an attack. With a<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（整齐的）</span>wound in its<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（唇）</span>caused by a<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（鲨鱼）</span>,this<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（灰色的）</span>seal was washed upside down by the tides<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（时不时地）</span>. But it tried to<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（轻轻碰撞）</span>Mark as if to<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（催促）</span>him to help it. So Mark abandoned fleeing away. With its teamwork, Mark used a<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（网）</span>to<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（拖）</span>the seal to the seal to the shallow water. Without pausing he pulled it out after a simple operation and settled it in a<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（狭窄的）</span>cave by the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（海边）</span>. Every time he brought it<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（可口的）</span>fish it would<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（叫唤）</span>and<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（吮吸）</span>his hands happily.<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（目击者）</span>said their<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（轶事）</span>reflected a magic<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（方面）</span>of the<span class=\"blank\"></span><span class=\"cue\">（关系）</span>between humans and animals.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"watermark\">[Watermark: vertical text, right side, illegible]</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
